    "quote": "there's so much noise in the emails",
    "context_summary": "Fallon reports that at Views at Sunset Ridge, venue guests responded more readily to text follow-ups about tours (including cancellations and feedback) than to email. Whitney agrees text is underutilized and suggests pre-tour texts that introduce the host with a photo and directions to build rapport before arrival.",
